DESCRIPTION:Three Fires Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/127-1158
 11\n\nCPR / AED / First Aid\, Wilderness First Aid\n\nCPR/AED Certificati
 on Classes\nBased on the 2010 International Consensus Guidelines for Card
 iopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) and Emergency Cardiac Care (ECC)\, CPR\, 
 and AED\, this course is designed to certify laypersons in CPR and AED.\n
 Certification is valid for 2 years\n.\nThis class includes:\nClear\, conc
 ise direction on how to perform CPR and use an AED during an emergency.\n
 Current information on injuries and illnesses: Core information for first
  aiders presented in a clear and straightforward form
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/127-115811
